TITLE Pyrite oxidation equilibrium with O2(g) at fixed PO2
SOLUTION 1 Pure water initial
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    pe 4
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    O2(g)   -0.7

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Pyrite    0  0.1
    Goethite  0  0
    Gypsum    0  0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
END
